      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:fb5db666cae6efb7",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "text": "Day 8 · Panoramic city tour of one of South America’s most European and cosmopolitan cities. Drive along Avenida 9 de Julio, home to the renowned Teatro Colón and the Obelisk, and visit Plaza de Mayo, surrounded by historic buildings such as the Casa Rosada, the Cathedral and the City Hall.\n\nContinue to Plaza San Martín, Avenida Alvear and Plaza del Congreso, along the historic Avenida de Mayo and lively Avenida Corrientes, and discover La Boca and San Telmo, the elegant districts of Palermo and Recoleta, and modern Puerto Madero, a busy dining and entertainment area.",
      "sourceTextSha256": "3f79d4271ecb5bc534548794f182bca23a4ac8603716c85f1b03935ced0d16a5",
      "provenance": {
